      "value": "@{60c0e22718009c104862d5bc|full_name} Would love to see this eventually! Can't promise anything though. I did the fix for 3.7.6 during personal time on my weekend because I've made the switch to Linux personally. I'm also not on the SDK team, so all of this was just of my own personal volition on my own time. It was small and simple enough that I could squeak it by without raising issues elsewhere.\n\nWould it be possible to add proton support to build & test? Absolutely. But there are definitely more hoops to go through in the process of getting something like that out vs this simple 1 line low risk low effort fix. I do appreciate the new canny though c:",
